    {id:'upwork-fee',title:'Upwork: freelancer service fees',url:'https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/211062538-Learn-about-the-Freelancer-Service-Fee',note:'Variable fee of 0–15% per contract since May 2025; many freelancers report about 10% in practice. The rate is shown before you accept, so use that number. New Indian profiles are often rejected or kept waiting in crowded categories, and some clients restrict jobs to specific countries.'},
    {id:'connects',title:'Upwork: Connects',url:'https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/211062898-Understanding-and-using-Connects',note:'Connects cost US$0.15 each (about ₹13). The free plan gives roughly 10 per month; a proposal usually costs 4–16 Connects. Ten proposals with no reply is common for a new profile—budget the cost before buying.'},
    {id:'upwork-pay',title:'Upwork: fixed-price payment timing',url:'https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/211063718-How-payments-for-milestones-and-fixed-price-contracts-work',note:'A client can use a 14-day review period; released money then has a five-day security hold. Check withdrawal timing as well.'},
    {id:'upwork-protect',title:'Upwork: funded milestone protection',url:'https://support.upwork.com/hc/en-us/articles/211063748-How-Fixed-Price-Payment-Protection-works-for-freelancers-on-Upwork',note:'Use funded milestones and the platform’s submission flow. A promise to pay outside that process is not the same protection.'},
    {id:'fiverr',title:'Fiverr: how it works for freelancers',url:'https://help.fiverr.com/hc/en-us/articles/34069565843985-How-Fiverr-works-for-freelancers',note:'Freelancers receive 80% of the order. Earnings clear 14 days after completion (7 days for Top Rated/Pro). Withdrawals to India then go through PayPal, Payoneer or bank transfer with their own fees—so a ₹1,000 order is roughly ₹750 in your bank, about three weeks later.'},
    {id:'prolific',title:'Prolific: supported participants',url:'https://participant-help.prolific.com/en/articles/445007-who-can-participate-in-studies-on-prolific',note:'India is on Prolific’s supported list (eligibility is by where you live, with an Indian ID). But Prolific itself describes India as a small participant pool, so very few studies target it. Treat it as occasional pocket money, not a plan.'},
    {id:'prolific-cash',title:'Prolific: cashing out',url:'https://participant-help.prolific.com/en/articles/445062-how-do-i-cash-out-on-prolific',note:'Cash-out requires at least £6/US$6 in combined approved balances and a compatible PayPal account.'},
    {id:'prolific-pay',title:'Prolific: study approval',url:'https://participant-help.prolific.com/en/articles/445059-when-will-i-be-paid-for-a-study',note:'Only approved submissions can be cashed out, and approval can take days or weeks. Completed participation is not cash available today.'},
    {id:'usertesting',title:'UserTesting: participant payments',url:'https://participant-support.usertesting.com/hc/en-us/articles/38814220821523-FAQ-Payments',note:'Payments arrive by PayPal about 14 days after a completed test; you must be 18+ with a verified PayPal account. Most tests target US/UK users, so screening out is normal from India.'},
    {id:'outlier',title:'Outlier: eligibility and payment FAQ',url:'https://outlier.ai/faq',note:'Requirements differ by role. India-specific coding roles have listed a CS degree as desirable and accepted current enrolment, with an advertised average around US$13.75/hour. Tasks are not guaranteed and can stop without notice.'},
    {id:'outlier-india',title:'Outlier: India coding role listing (example)',url:'https://builtinhyderabad.in/job/coding-expertise-ai-training/3405303',note:'An India-only listing for coding experts (Java, Python, JS/TS or C++). A listing can close at any time; apply only through Outlier’s official site, never through a Telegram/WhatsApp “agent”.'},
    {id:'outlier-rules',title:'Outlier: contributor community guidelines',url:'https://outlier.ai/legal/community-guidelines',note:'Follow task rules, including restrictions on outside tools. Access to an AI assistant is not permission to use it in an assessment or task.'},
    {id:'amazon',title:'Amazon India Associates: payment schedule',url:'https://affiliate-program.amazon.in/help/node/topic/GKDG94FQSRXSJCGK',note:'Payments are approximately 60 days after the month in which fees are earned, subject to payment rules. Affiliate commissions are not immediate cash.'},
    {id:'youtube',title:'YouTube Partner Programme: eligibility',url:'https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/72851',note:'Monetisation requires eligibility, thresholds and review. Publishing a video does not create immediate income.'},
    {id:'gumroad',title:'Gumroad: fees',url:'https://gumroad.com/help/article/66-gumroads-fees',note:'10% + US$0.50 per direct sale (30% via Discover), plus payment processing. On a ₹149 product the fixed fee alone is about a third of the price. Check whether bank payouts to India are available in your dashboard before building anything.'},
    {id:'tuition-rates',title:'UrbanPro: what tutors charge for home tuition',url:'https://www.urbanpro.com/tuition-fee/what-can-be-the-reasonable-home-tuition-fee',note:'Tutor-reported rates: about ₹200–300 per hour per student in cities (₹100–150 in small towns), roughly ₹2,000–3,000 a month for class 6–8. Self-reported and undated, so ask locally too.'},
    {id:'urbanpro',title:'UrbanPro: list yourself as a tutor',url:'https://www.urbanpro.com/',note:'Indian tutoring marketplace. A free profile can bring enquiries; paid leads are optional and not needed to start.'},
    {id:'reel-rates',title:'Freelancer.in: Instagram reel editing request (India)',url:'https://www.freelancer.in/projects/video-services/instagram-reel-video-editor-india-40371595',note:'Indian clients post reel jobs at around ₹400 per reel; experienced editors quote ₹1,000–₹1,200. Some posts offer ₹50—ignore those.'},
    {id:'internshala',title:'Internshala: work-from-home internships',url:'https://internshala.com/',note:'The standard Indian student internship site. Filter “Work from home” + “Paid”. Typical stipends cited range from about ₹3,000 to ₹15,000/month. Never pay a fee to an employer or a “training” company to get selected.'},
    {id:'pm-internship',title:'PM Internship Scheme (official portal)',url:'https://pminternship.mca.gov.in/',note:'₹5,000/month for 12 months, but only for ages 21–24 who are NOT in full-time education. A regular full-time college student is not eligible.'},
    {id:'cybercrime',title:'National Cyber Crime Reporting Portal',url:'https://cybercrime.gov.in/',note:'Report job/task scams here. For money already lost, call 1930 immediately—the first hours matter for freezing the receiving account.'},
    {id:'incometax',title:'Income Tax Department e-filing portal',url:'https://www.incometax.gov.in/iec/foportal/',note:'Official source for slabs and filing. Under the new regime, the basic exemption is ₹4 lakh and the Section 87A rebate makes normal income up to ₹12 lakh tax-free. Confirm current rules here or with a CA.'},
    {id:'purpose-code',title:'Skydo: purpose code P0802 for freelancers',url:'https://www.skydo.com/blog/p0802-purpose-code-guide',note:'Foreign payments for software/professional services usually use purpose code P0802. Your bank or payment app asks for it; keep the FIRC/FIRA it gives you. Vendor blog—confirm with your bank.'},
    {id:'paypal-india',title:'Skydo: receiving international payments in India (fee comparison)',url:'https://www.skydo.com/blog/best-international-payment-platforms-for-freelancers-india',note:'PayPal India charges about 4.4% + a fixed fee plus a 3–4% currency spread, often 7–9% in total. Payoneer, Wise and Skydo are usually cheaper. Vendor source—compare the final INR you actually receive.'},
    {id:'prolific-pool',title:'Prolific: who the participants are',url:'https://researcher-help.prolific.com/en/articles/445224-who-are-the-participants-on-prolific',note:'Prolific lists India among countries with small participant populations, which means few studies are open to you.'},
    {id:'fiverr-clearance',title:'Wise: how Fiverr payments work',url:'https://wise.com/gb/blog/fiverr-payments',note:'Confirms the 14-day standard clearance, 7 days for higher seller tiers, and a 1% fee for early payout where available.'}
